[B]What's working:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Display
[*]Audio playback
[*]Audio recording
[*]Video playback
[*]WiFi
[*]Wifi tethering
[*]Camera (photos, camcorder & panorama)
[*]Touch
[*]GPS
[*]Bluetooth
[*]Bluetooth tethering
[*]Sensors
[*]Compass
[*]Hardware acceleration and OpenGL rendering
[*]Hardware video decoding & encoding
[*]Video recording
[*]HQ Video
[*]Accelerometer
[*]USB mass storage
[*]Sd card
[/LIST]

[B]Not working:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]GSM
[*]Receiving and making calls
[*]Sending/receiving SMS/MMS
[*]Fm Radio
[*]Offline charging - it's buggy
[/LIST]

[B]Instructions for flashing:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Make sure you run latest TWRP Recovery ([URL="http://android-latino.org/index.php?topic=1069.0"]APK from [MENTION=6062450]ElDainosor[/MENTION] ported by ensarman[/URL] or [URL="http://xdaforums.com/optimus-l3-l5-l7-l9-ii/orig-development/recovery-twrp-3-0-0-0-l3ii-l1ii-t3348137"]Zip/Img from [MENTION=5842851]Caio99BR[/MENTION][/URL]
[*]Download the ROM
[*]Download GAPPS of your preference.
[*]Place in the card
[*]Reboot to recovery
[*]Make backup of Nandroid
[*]Wipe Data/Factory Reset
[*]Install the ROM
[*]Install GAPPS
[*]Reboot
[*]Enjoy !
[/LIST]

